<title>USA: Court declines to enjoin offer for NYSEG.</title>
<headline>Court declines to enjoin offer for NYSEG.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. District Court for the Southern District of New York denied New York State Electric &amp; Gas Corp's request for a preliminary injunction regarding CalEnergy Co Inc's pending tender offer for 9.9 percent of NYSEG's stock, CalEnergy said Thursday.</p>
<p>Its statement noted the offer is scheduled to expire at 2400 EDT (0400 GMT Aug 15).</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
